# The environment of a devnet run. These keys are the devnet's own and are
# not secret: the chain they spend on is created empty by devnet/start.sh and
# deleted by devnet/reset.sh, and the funding wallet is filled from the
# devnet faucet. The mnemonic is the one every devnet run derives the funding
# wallet, the owner candidates, the agent, the recipient and the rotation
# keys from, so a run is reproducible.
CARDANO_NETWORK=devnet
FUNDING_MNEMONIC=absurd avoid scissors anxiety gather lottery category door army half long cage bachelor another expect people blade school educate curtain scrub monitor lady beyond

# The mnemonic the devnet genesis funds, which the bootstrap spends from to
# fill the funding wallet. It is the one the devnet image creates its cluster
# with, so it is the same on every devnet.
DEVNET_GENESIS_MNEMONIC=test test test test test test test test test test test test test test test test test test test test test test test sauce
